Every pain-equity-duty-holder should mitigate a potential-care-barrier for a sociodemographic-group.
Every pain-equity-duty-holder may use a linguistically-tailored-care for a potential-care-barrier-mitigation and may use a cost-assistance-program for a potential-care-barrier-mitigation.
If a pharmacotherapy is appropriate for a patient then every pain-equity-duty-holder should ensure a pharmacotherapy-access for the patient.
If a psychological-support is needed for a patient then every pain-equity-duty-holder should ensure a psychological-support-access for the patient.
If a physical-therapy is needed for a patient then every pain-equity-duty-holder should ensure a physical-therapy-access for the patient.
